  "problem": "Carmen has a piece of fabric with a length of $5\\,\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\text{m}.$ She accidentally spills coffee on this piece, so she decides to cut out and discard $1\\,\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\text{m}$ of fabric. How long is the remaining piece of fabric? Express your answer as a **mixed number** in simplest form.\n\nThe remaining piece of fabric has a length of\n{{field-1}}\n$\\text{m}.$",
